<main class="wrap">
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Dev converters</p>
<h1>JSON, YAML, Base64 — in seconds</h1>
<p>Formatting and validation for JSON, minification, key sorting, JSON ↔ YAML conversion, Base64 and URL encoding. No backend, everything in the browser. Copy, download and share via link.</p>
</section>
<div class="answer" id="tldr"><b>TL;DR:</b> paste JSON → “Format” (2/4 spaces) or “Minify”. On error we show the line. For YAML — “JSON → YAML” and back. For Base64 — UTF-8 encoding. History is stored locally.</div>

<section class="calc" id="calc" aria-label="JSON/YAML/Base64 converter">
<div class="calc-layout">
<div class="calc-fields">
<label>Input <textarea id="inp" rows="10" placeholder='{"name":"Ivan","age":30,"tags":["dev","json"]}' style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;resize:vertical;min-height:160px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)"></textarea></label>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
<label style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Indent <select id="indent" style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)"><option value="2">2 spaces</option><option value="4">4 spaces</option><option value="tab">Tab</option></select></label>
<label style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)"><input id="sort" type="checkbox" /> Sort keys</label>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn" id="fmt">Format</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="mini">Minify</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="validate">Validate</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="j2y">JSON → YAML</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="y2j">YAML → JSON</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="b64e">Base64 ↑</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="b64d">Base64 ↓</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="urlE">URL ↑</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="urlD">URL ↓</button>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<button class="btn ghost" id="copyOut">Copy</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="download">Download .json</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="clear">Clear</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="share">Share</button>
</div>
<p id="stats" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0">Paste JSON, YAML or Base64. Example: &#123;&quot;hello&quot;:&quot;world&quot;&#125;</p>
</div>
